---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — M. Berkan Taştan">
  <section class="shell py-20">
    <p class="kicker mb-4">Profile</p>
    <h1 class="max-w-4xl text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-white sm:text-6xl">About</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-400">
      I am an R&D engineer with a background in marine engineering, working across simulation software, digital twins, mathematical modelling, energy efficiency and technical system design.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr]">
      <div class="card p-7">
        <p class="kicker">Engineering approach</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-bold text-white">From physical system to executable model.</h2>
        <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 leading-7 text-slate-400">
          <p>I am especially interested in turning complex machinery and ship systems into understandable, testable and interactive software models.</p>
          <p>My work combines engineering research, system architecture, simulation logic, interface design, validation and technical documentation. I use this site to document that process and publish selected work in an open and reproducible format.</p>
          <p>My longer-term focus is the integration of software with real hardware: sensors, data acquisition, control systems and physical equipment connected to simulation and digital-twin environments.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="glass rounded-3xl p-7">
        <p class="kicker">Core areas</p>
        <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {[
            'Marine Engineering',
            'Engine Room Simulation',
            'Digital Twins',
            'Unity / C#',
            'Python',
            'LabVIEW',
            'Energy Efficiency',
            'Control Systems',
            'Hardware Integration',
            'Technical Documentation'
          ].map((item) => <span class="tag">{item}</span>)}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="card p-6">
        <p class="mono text-xs text-cyan-300">01 / RESEARCH</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-bold">Understand the system</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">Study manuals, standards, operating logic, physical constraints and real engineering data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-6">
        <p class="mono text-xs text-cyan-300">02 / BUILD</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-bold">Create the model</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">Translate system behaviour into software architecture, mathematics, simulation logic and interfaces.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-6">
        <p class="mono text-xs text-cyan-300">03 / VALIDATE</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-bold">Test against reality</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">Validate behaviour, document assumptions and improve the model through structured testing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
